      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, you’ve brought an Inkay! Thanks so much!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200079006F0075201900760065002000620072006F007500670068007400200061006E00200049006E006B0061007900210020005400680061006E006B007300200073006F0020006D007500630068002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’ll scoop up just a few drops of ink, if you don’t\nmind, Inkay...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006C006C002000730063006F006F00700020007500700020006A007500730074002000610020006600650077002000640072006F007000730020006F006600200069006E006B002C00200069006600200079006F007500200064006F006E20190074000A006D0069006E0064002C00200049006E006B00610079002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My! The ink has such a deep black color!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1076,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D00790021002000540068006500200069006E006B002000680061007300200073007500630068002000610020006400650065007000200062006C00610063006B00200063006F006C006F0072002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m so curious to see what happens when this is\nmixed into a perfume. I’ll be right back!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "My Inkay perfume is all finished!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D007900200049006E006B00610079002000700065007200660075006D006500200069007300200061006C006C002000660069006E00690073006800650064002100100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It has a sharp, refreshing scent to it—just like a\nsalty ocean breeze!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 75
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But there’s a little problem...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200074006800650072006520190073002000610020006C006900740074006C0065002000700072006F0062006C0065006D002E002E002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "The scent does stimulate the appetite quite a lot.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054006800650020007300630065006E007400200064006F006500730020007300740069006D0075006C0061007400650020007400680065002000610070007000650074006900740065002000710075006900740065002000610020006C006F0074002E00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 55
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Of course, people may find clever uses for it, but\nit’ll be tricky to sell as a regular perfume.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Still, we managed to create yet another wonderful\nscent, didn’t we?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300740069006C006C002C0020007700650020006D0061006E006100670065006400200074006F0020006300720065006100740065002000790065007400200061006E006F007400680065007200200077006F006E00640065007200660075006C000A007300630065006E0074002C0020006400690064006E20190074002000770065003F00100002011401310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "So I’d say everything turned out Inkay!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕı",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2116,
